    },
    {
      "text": "支持单人或最多四人合作，并提供四个新职业和五张地图。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Features both single-player mode and up to 4-player co-op multiplayer. Four new distinct classes to choose from. Five different maps.",
